Javascript is used as a scripting language on the web to improve the functionality of HTML and CSS with more advanced features than those two can natively support
It's an interpreted, turing complete language
alert displays an alert to the top of the page
prompt prompts the user for something
confirm prompts the user to confirm intent
all three display the message that you type

Security practices:
Always minify and obfuscate
use external js and do not allow files that you have not created yourself to be interpreted and read by the application/browser as part of the application
Do not blindly include other files
Set rate limits to alerts